{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05780","headline":"八月十五日象自江东止田园移庄庆会未几归汶上小弟幼妹尤嗟其别兼赋是诗三首 二 · 卢象","name":"八月十五日象自江东止田园移庄庆会未几归汶上小弟幼妹尤嗟其别兼赋是诗三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两妹日长成，双鬟将及人。\n已能持宝瑟，自解掩罗巾。\n念昔别时小，未知疎与亲。\n今来识离恨，掩泪方殷勤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05780.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05780","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}